---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Strong Towns Worcester, MA | Building a More Resilient City">
    <section class="pt-12 md:pt-16 pb-6">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
            <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
                <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-stw-primary mb-4">
                    Strong Towns Worcester
                </h1>
                <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
                    Empowering Worcester to build a resilient and inclusive community where walking, biking, and incremental development thrive. Together we advocate and act to create vibrant neighborhoods and transportation freedom.
                </p>
                <a href="https://discord.gg/JszTyuxxaZ" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block bg-stw-primary hover:opacity-90 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl">
                    Join our Discord
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pt-6 pb-16 md:pb-24">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-7xl">
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center text-gray-900 mb-12">Our Core Goals</h2>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <!-- Goal 1 -->
                <div class="bg-stw-primary p-8 rounded-3xl hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full group">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-4xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-sm">
                        🚲
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-stw-secondary mb-3">Safe Streets</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-left">
We believe everyone deserves to get home safely. By <a href="https://www.strongtowns.org/streets" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stw-secondary underline hover:text-white">designing streets</a> that offer safe choices for walking and biking, we make our city a nicer place to spend time, while protecting our children, seniors, and neighbors with disabilities. These improvements create more vibrant neighborhoods and reduce traffic for those who drive by giving others a practical way to get around. This productive approach saves lives, eases the commute, and helps our <a href="https://www.strongtowns.org/parking" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stw-secondary underline hover:text-white">local businesses thrive</a>.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Goal 2 -->
                <div class="bg-stw-primary p-8 rounded-3xl hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full group">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-4xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-sm">
                        🚌
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-stw-secondary mb-3">Better Transit</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-left">
A strong town needs a transit system that is a reliable choice for every resident, not just a last resort. Frequent, dependable buses connect people to jobs and help the city run more efficiently. By making transit an enjoyable and high-quality option, we provide independence for those who cannot drive while reducing congestion for those who do. It’s a common-sense way to expand freedom of movement for all of Worcester.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Goal 3 -->
                <div class="bg-stw-primary p-8 rounded-3xl hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col items-center text-center h-full group">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-4xl mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-sm">
                        🏗️
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-stw-secondary mb-3">Local Accountability</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-left">
We actively support the <a href="https://www.worcesterma.gov/worcester-now-next" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stw-secondary underline hover:text-white">Now | Next Citywide Plan</a>, the <a href="https://www.worcesterma.gov/mobility/vision-zero" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stw-secondary underline hover:text-white">Vision Zero initiative</a>, the <a href="https://www.worcesterma.gov/mobility/worcester-mobility-action-plan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stw-secondary underline hover:text-white">Mobility Action Plan</a>, and the <a href="https://www.worcesterma.gov/housing-neighborhood-development/housing-production-plan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stw-secondary underline hover:text-white">Housing Production Plan</a> to make Worcester more self-reliant, accessible, and affordable. By championing these specific plans, we ensure our tax dollars go toward <a href="https://www.strongtowns.org/housing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stw-secondary underline hover:text-white">building housing</a> and infrastructure that offer a <a href="https://www.strongtowns.org/accounting" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-stw-secondary underline hover:text-white">real return for our community</a>. This focus on results ensures every resident can participate in our local economy and contributes to a more resilient future for everyone.                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>